\cf2\fs32 9-KEY BUSINESS INSIGHTS\par
      \cf0\fs24 The analysis of the food delivery data provides the following business insights:\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl240\slmult1           Revenue analysis helps understand the overall business performance.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}          Order analysis identifies order trends and status distribution.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}          Restaurant analysis highlights top-performing restaurants.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}         Cuisine analysis identifies popular food categories.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}        Customer spending analysis helps identify valuable customers.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}       Delivery analysis helps evaluate delivery efficiency.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}       Customer ratings help understand customer satisfaction.\par

\pard\sa200\sl240\slmult1\cf2\fs32 10-CONCLUSION\par
      \cf0\fs24 This project analyzed food delivery data using Python, SQL, and Power BI. Python was used for data cleaning and analysis, SQL for business analysis, and Power BI for dashboard creation. The project helped me improve my data analytics skills and understand business performance, customer behavior, and delivery efficiency.\par

